OL,3,GNEWSATourist tax likely as visitors
OL,4,A'need to contribute'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new tourist tax for two cities is
OL,7,Flikely to come into effect, as a
OL,8,Fcouncil leader says tourists "need to
OL,9,Fcontribute".
OL,11,FUnder new government plans, regional
OL,12,Fmayors will have the power to introduce
OL,13,Fa tax on overnight accommodation stays
OL,14,Fin places like Bristol and Bath.
OL,16,FHelen Godwin, mayor of the West of
OL,17,FEngland Combined Authority (Weca), said
OL,18,Fshe was in favour of the scheme, with
OL,19,Fhopes the money could be reinvested
OL,20,Finto improving transport. But
OL,21,Fhospitality leaders fear it could drive
OL,22,Foff customers.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
