OL,3,GNEWSATourist tax likely as visitors
OL,4,A'need to contribute'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Bath and North East
OL,7,FSomerset Council, councillor Kevin Guy,
OL,8,Fsaid: "There are five million visitors
OL,9,Fevery year to the city of Bath alone,
OL,10,Fand they have a huge impact on the
OL,11,Fpublic realm."
